result
result-*

# Ignore automatically generated direnv output
.direnv

# Ignore NixOS interactive test driver history
**/.nixos-test-history

# Ignore vscode shit
.vscode*

# personal reminders and notes
*srv*
**srv**

# personal config (use utils/gen-stubcfg.sh if you need a template with the default options)
*cfg.nix
